skills/adversarial-research_SKILL.md:89:Specific finding that would invalidate the recommendation. Multiple disjunctive conditions OK. Vague conditions ("better evidence") are not acceptable.
skills/adversarial-research_SKILL.md:343:If you cannot honestly populate all 5 fields with specific content, the gap should remain OPEN. "NOT-RESEARCHED" is acceptable; vague closure is not.
skills/citation-miner_SKILL.md:16:**Connectors:** PubMed (required), Scholar Gateway (preferred for forward), Consensus (optional). CrossRef via web_fetch acceptable for backward when PubMed lacks the record. Activate for mining.
skills/cross-population-conflict-mapper_SKILL.md:19:**Model:** Sonnet-class (retrieval/collation) · Opus-class or above (resolution synthesis + best-practice determination)
