skills/functional-deficit-researcher_SKILL.md:210:1. **Write findings to BPC** — GET `references/best-practices-compendium.md` + SHA. Append to relevant slug(s) under `### Bottom-up findings`. PUT back. Commit: `functional-deficit-researcher: append bottom-up findings [{YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM}]`
skills/gap-driven-mining_SKILL.md:32:- **Cochrane Library** (via `web_fetch` to cochranelibrary.com) — required for SR-meta gap patterns. Web_fetch acceptable.
skills/multilingual-research_SKILL.md:6:  findings in English with best-practice judgment for each population. ALWAYS use when: researching
